00:04:13.862 --> 00:04:14.695
- [Joshua] I know what that is.

00:04:14.695 --> 00:04:17.232
(audience cheering)

00:04:17.232 --> 00:04:18.632
- Did you eat it?
- Mm hmm.

00:04:18.632 --> 00:04:19.965
- Can I try?
- I ate that.

00:04:19.965 --> 00:04:20.798
That one was really good.

00:04:20.798 --> 00:04:23.196
(audience cheering)

00:04:23.196 --> 00:04:24.029
- 30 seconds.

00:04:24.029 --> 00:04:25.587
(pensive music continues)

00:04:25.587 --> 00:04:26.720
You didn't even taste it.
- How 'bout this?

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:29.977
I don't even know what to do with it.

00:04:29.977 --> 00:04:30.902
- How are you doing?

00:04:30.902 --> 00:04:32.388
30 seconds, go, go, go.

00:04:32.388 --> 00:04:35.697
- [Audience] Four, three, two, one.

00:04:35.697 --> 00:04:38.129
(air horn sound)

00:04:38.129 --> 00:04:38.962
- I feel like I'm wrong,

00:04:38.962 --> 00:04:39.870
- Uh, okay.

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:41.460
- I'm wrong, I'm wrong, I'm
wrong, I know I'm wrong.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:42.403
- I feel sorry for if,
- I panicked!

00:04:42.403 --> 00:04:44.130
- anyone got the lobster wrong,

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.742
but I'll pray for you
tonight if that's the case.

00:04:45.742 --> 00:04:46.575
- Okay.

00:04:46.575 --> 00:04:47.640
- All right, so let's
start with you, Kelly.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:48.473
- [Kelly] Sure.

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:50.483
- Mmm.

00:04:50.483 --> 00:04:52.227
- I, ah, oh.

00:04:52.227 --> 00:04:53.700
- All right, we're gonna come back to you

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:55.890
