some time unpacking.

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:59.580
- This saddest, the saddest,
saddest display, I got one.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:00.783
- Oh, okay.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:02.790
Close.
- Damn.

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:04.890
- [Christine] Oh, no.
- You got these two flipped,

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:06.475
so you have two points, okay.

00:05:06.475 --> 00:05:07.800
(audience applauds)

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:08.633
- [Christine] No.

00:05:08.633 --> 00:05:09.480
- Oh, no.

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:11.400
- I had it right originally,

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:12.870
and then I switched it last minute.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.610
- [Kristen] Okay, so you
also have two points.

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:15.518
- [Christine] Yes.

00:05:15.518 --> 00:05:16.351
(audience applauds)

00:05:16.351 --> 00:05:17.909
