00:05:29.693 --> 00:05:30.526
- if you did not get that right,

00:05:30.526 --> 00:05:31.794
I have deep concerns for you.

00:05:31.794 --> 00:05:32.970
- Yeah, would've been really sad.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:35.220
- So, a tie between the two of you.

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:36.257
- Uh huh.
- Yep.

00:05:36.257 --> 00:05:38.280
- I don't have a tiebreaker.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:39.150
- Okay.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.230
- But I feel like,

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.063
- Well I can, can I,

00:05:41.063 --> 00:05:43.230
- You can have two winners,
but we still have one loser.

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.152
- here's the thing, thanks
for pointing it out.

00:05:45.152 --> 00:05:45.985
(all laugh)

00:05:45.985 --> 00:05:47.520
Thanks for pointing it out, Kristen.

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:49.800
So, I don't care that
I lost, it's my show.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.123
My name is up there.
(all laugh)

00:05:51.123 --> 00:05:53.760
All right, so everybody in
the audience is going home

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:55.568
