00:06:00.878 --> 00:06:03.633
One stove, two separate
ovens can cook two meals

00:06:03.633 --> 00:06:06.930
in two different ways to
eliminate back to back cooking.

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:08.170
Thank you so much, Ninja.

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:10.687
Y'all, be sure to catch Chef
Kristen Kish's new show,

00:06:10.687 --> 00:06:12.211
